<section class="hero"><div class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">COACH V1 · RULES, NOT BLACK BOX</p><h1>Useful next steps, with reasons you can inspect.</h1><p class="lead">Coach v1 reads your goal, completed/pending Missions, Performance, private readiness band and Momentum. It does not use a generative AI model and does not invent learner facts.</p><p class="explain">Each recommendation shows a stable reason code. Raw readiness answers are not copied into Coach telemetry; only the readiness band may be used for workload guidance.</p></div>
<aside class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">WEEKLY SUMMARY</p><div class="summary"><div class="metric"><strong><?=intval($summary['training_days']??0)?></strong><small>training days · 7d</small></div><div class="metric"><strong><?=intval($summary['missions_completed']??0)?></strong><small>missions completed</small></div><div class="metric"><strong><?=intval($summary['training_minutes']??0)?></strong><small>training minutes</small></div><div class="metric"><strong><?=intval($summary['weekly_goal_progress']??0)?>%</strong><small>weekly goal</small></div></div><p class="explain"><?php if(!empty($summary['top_arena'])):?>Most active Arena: <strong><?=h($arenas[$summary['top_arena']]??ucfirst((string)$summary['top_arena']))?></strong>. <?php endif;?>Readiness check-ins this week: <?=intval($summary['readiness_checkins']??0)?>.</p></aside></section>

<section class="rec-grid"><?php if(!$recommendations):?><article class="panel"><h2>No Coach action needed right now.</h2><p class="empty">Your current plan is already clear. Use Today for Missions and Progress for review.</p></article><?php else:?><?php foreach($recommendations as$r):?><article class="panel rec"><span class="tag"><?=h(strtoupper((string)($r['priority']??'normal')))?> · <?=h(strtoupper((string)($r['type']??'coach')))?></span><h2><?=h((string)$r['title'])?></h2><p><?=h((string)$r['body'])?></p><?php if(!empty($r['evidence'])):?><div class="evidence"><?php foreach((array)$r['evidence'] as$key=>$value):?><div><strong><?=h(str_replace('_',' ',(string)$key))?>:</strong> <?=h(is_scalar($value)?(string)$value:'—')?></div><?php endforeach;?></div><?php endif;?><div class="reason">REASON · <?=h((string)$r['reason_code'])?></div><form class="accept" method="post" action="<?=h(app_url('coach/action'))?>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=h(global_csrf())?>"><input type="hidden" name="recommendation_id" value="<?=h((string)$r['id'])?>"><button class="primary"><?=h((string)$r['action_label'])?> →</button></form></article><?php endforeach;?><?php endif;?></section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-top:20px"><p class="eyebrow">HOW COACH V1 DECIDES</p><p class="explain">Priority order: comeback/recovery → readiness-aware workload → goal-aligned pending Mission → weekly rhythm → milestone prompt. Recommendations are recomputed from current state each time. No recommendation changes a Mission by itself; you remain in control of the action.</p></section>
